HTTrack 3.50.1: engine update and crash fixes.

• Fixed crashes: a project name with a slash, screen rotation, and opening a large log
• Long crawls no longer freeze the progress screen
• Updating a mirror now refreshes pages that changed
• Mirrored JavaScript and stylesheets work again
• A visited page can no longer make HTTrack send a file from your phone
• Stop then Continue resumes part-downloaded files

A crawl interrupted before this update starts over once.